# Example 1

### Input

```text
3 8
3 7 10
```

### Output

```text
3
```

### Explanation

For `D = 3`:

```text
ceil(3/3) + ceil(7/3) + ceil(10/3)
= 1 + 3 + 4
= 8
```

Since `8 <= T`, the divisor is valid.

